contentText:
NCT 127 is officially kicking off its next chapter as a quintet.

On Tuesday (Aug. 11), the Seoul-based group released an energetic and upbeat video for their track “Piñata.” With this, the group is giving fans a first taste of their seventh studio album, BLINGY, out Aug. 24. The project will feature nine tracks and marks the group’s first full-length album in two years.&nbsp;

